# crypto-audit Rule

1. Follow `.agents/skills/crypto-audit/references/crypto_checklist.md` (CRY-001 to CRY-015, CRY-V-*).
2. Run `.agents/skills/crypto-audit/scripts/crypto_scan.py` on source and `scripts/cipher_analyze.py` on your own tokens.
3. Never use exposed keys against production or crack real users' hashes; padding-oracle and timing tests are detection-only.
